# Installer artifacts

Display name (`productName`, Start Menu) may contain spaces or capitals.

**Bundle filenames must be kebab-case** from `package.json` `name`:

`{name}_{version}_{arch}-setup.exe` — e.g. `my-image_0.1.86_x64-setup.exe`

- Tauri 2.11 has no installer-filename setting. Wrap `tauri` with `scripts/tauri.mjs` + `scripts/rename-bundle-artifacts.mjs`.
- Rename **only the current version**. Do not rewrite leftover older files in `target/`.
- Electron: set `artifactName` to kebab-case; do not interpolate `${productName}` into filenames.
- Do not change `productName` / window title just to fix the filename.
